{
  "_comment": "Keyword rules TileLibrary.mjs uses to sort data/tile-pack-index.json entries into the six data/narrative-lexicon.json themeCategories. Rules are checked in order, case-insensitively, as a substring match against the file's basename (no extension); the first match wins. A file matching nothing falls back to _generic, same as the hand-curated assets/tiles/dungeon/_generic/ scaffold. Edit this file directly to retune matches - no regeneration step needed, TileLibrary.mjs reads it fresh each run.",
